## What this covers

The non-code content of this repository:

- `data/` — all derived pipeline outputs (clustering, scoring, topics) and the
  Gemma validation run records
- `figures/` — figure images (`.pdf`, `.png`); the generating `.py` scripts are
  MIT-licensed, see [LICENSE](LICENSE)
- `paper/` — the manuscript source and PDF
- `docs/presentations/` — our own presentation files and speaker notes

