## What this does NOT cover

- **The underlying Community Notes data.** Every derived file in `data/` traces
  back to X's public Community Notes snapshot, retrieved on 2026-05-08 from
  <https://x.com/i/communitynotes/download-data>. That source data remains
  subject to X's own terms; our license applies only to the derived artifacts
  and the analysis expressed in them. No raw snapshot files are redistributed
  here.
- **Model outputs.** The Gemma validation records in `data/llm_validation/` were
  produced with Gemma 4 31B IT, whose use is governed by Google's Gemma Terms of
  Use.
